cad-wine-launcher (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Provide a complete preconfigured Flatpak Wine environment.
  * Require the user to obtain Autodesk Fusion through Autodesk's account and
    terms flow, while automating the Wine-side installation.
  * Add the shared H: drive and GitHub-hosted release workflow.
  * Use lowercase, versioned release artifact filenames.

